{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47780","headline":"嫁女诗 三 · 嵩岳诸仙","name":"嫁女诗 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"八马回乘汗漫风，犹思往事憩昭宫。\n宴移玄圃情方洽，乐奏钧天曲未终。\n斜汉露凝残月冷，流霞杯泛曙光红。\n崑仑回首不知处，疑是酒酣魂梦中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"嵩岳诸仙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47780.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47780","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}